          <description>Directrix&apos;s MAT and RAT are each equal to her FOCUS for one turn.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="0cf1-1f7e-d943-4689" name="Activate Exponent Servitor" hidden="false">
          <description>At the end of your Control Phase, you can put one Exponent Servitor into play within 1&quot; of this model if there are fewer than two Exponent Servitors in play in Directrix&apos;s battlegroup.</description>
